---
// Section divider: fading gold hairlines around a cinnabar lozenge.
---

<div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-container-max items-center gap-4 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-gold/40"></span>
  <span class="h-2 w-2 rotate-45 bg-cinnabar"></span>
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-gold/40"></span>
</div>
